This repository contains ports of, and test data from, other projects:

- The Hippogriff reference implementation (Owen Lynch; Apache-2.0):
  src/Hg/Core, src/Hg/Elab, src/Hg/Parse/Config.purs, src/Hg/Eval are
  ports of its modules; test/golden/*.hpgf and *.output are its golden
  tests.
- fnotation (MPL-2.0): src/Hg/Parse/FNotation.purs is a port and stays
  under MPL-2.0.
- diagnostician (Apache-2.0 OR MIT): the diagnostic format in
  src/Hg/Support/Diagnostic.purs follows it.
- prettyprinter (BSD-2-Clause): src/Hg/Support/Pretty.purs reimplements its
  layout algorithm.

No license has been chosen yet for the rest of this repository.
